 using large language models they are, it's like a at this point everyone technical realizes they're like a critical resource to make", "source_revision": "31523d5a855c2b662281bf3619ba6e6e0b42e5bf87befd619421fe4d44ad9dc1", "video_id": "2090523526595854336"}}, "c144-1": {"card_key": "c144", "kind": "candidate", "support": {"card_hash": "8d7e37128c22a259783a570a5832460bcd6f6bc2c0d207e75a8bdb2a01f9c165", "excerpt_id": "1bbf3c8eab7424acc97fa6676c345d0c25760aad2cfbcfb03a9d15d7c47affc6", "quote": "OpenAI and Anthropic finally have real competition.", "source_revision": "841b95db57cd50946693bbf8d2bdcb895e3b7718232e36051669017992674a15", "video_id": "2090544926706876416"}}, "c144-2": {"card_key": "c144", "kind": "disposition", "support": {"card_hash": "8d7e37128c22a259783a570a5832460bcd6f6bc2c0d207e75a8bdb2a01f9c165", "excerpt_id": "1bbf3c8eab7424acc97fa6676c345d0c25760aad2cfbcfb03a9d15d7c47affc6", "quote": "OpenAI and Anthropic finally have real competition.", "source_revision": "841b95db57cd50946693bbf8d2bdcb895e3b7718232e36051669017992674a15", "video_id": "2090544926706876416"}}, "c150-1": {"card_key": "c150", "kind": "disposition", "support": {"card_hash": "a0b317ff753327be1b02075a5e53d05dce470f4a71803a212fa3e6677658caf4", "excerpt_id": "edff50a0d895c8153820abef8bd96cf11795e4e88056f128e5cd80a895adb6ed", "quote": "a skill people at Anthropic have been using a lot recently: ELI5", "source_revision": "734a579fb1c550ef11621e425181d05cec6fd37ab36661a0764432959ca115e5", "video_id": "2090849386284863488"}}, "c152-1": {"card_key": "c152", "kind": "candidate", "support": {"card_hash": "30829130f9f339dd196eeaafaa8532d3563ec1fdfbd72815394b5ac297535c55", "excerpt_id": "cd85ba691fda2c37a23a930fd345166d9cc51ce6683855a9ef816c062a465066", "quote": "Six AI agents, $200 a month, doing the work BlackRock pays people six figures for.", "source_revision": "eace62ed1fa6c0762ecb5ae0d63a21cb090b28c7a408c5c78583902e178bfd2b", "video_id": "2090883364936986624"}}, "c152-2": {"card_key": "c152", "