ess-process agent reads data and executes an action, such as building and shipping an ad campaign", "AI-built deliverable assembled automatically by the product, such as a slide deck", "Autonomous-vehicle or robotic model making real-world physical decisions (e.g., driving)", "Founder/product framing that positions AI as now doing a user's computer-based work for them"], "path": ["AI and ML", "AI Agents and Automation"], "sibling_cues": [{"confusing_alternative": "Developer Tools (coding agent harness)", "evidence_needed": "The task target must be a real-world consumer/business action (food, flights, shopping), not code review or an IDE workflow.", "include_cue": "Agent completes a multi-step real-world task end-to-end without manual step-by-step direction"}, {"confusing_alternative": "AI Industry and Business (company/executive commentary)", "evidence_needed": "Card must show the agent performing the task itself, not commentary about a company's competitive position.", "include_cue": "Marketing/business-process agent reads data and executes an action"}, {"confusing_alternative": "Frontier Models (capability release)", "evidence_needed": "Evidence must describe the finished task/output produced, not an architecture or benchmark detail.", "include_cue": "AI-built deliverable assembled automatically by the product"}, {"confusing_alternative": "Security (agent safety/guardrail incident)", "evidence_needed": "Card must describe the model performing the driving/task capability, not a safety failure or containment mechanism.", "include_cue": "Autonomous-vehicle or robotic model making real-world physical decisions"}, {"confusing_alternative": "AI Industry and Business (founder/company narrative)", "evidence_needed": "Card must center on what the product functionally does for the user, not funding, rivalry, or market-share framing.", "include_cue": "Founder/product framing that AI now does a user's computer-based work"}], "supporting_evidence": [{"card_hash": "35d597a088f9e08f951b6e82c251bdbf6755d3f8230e57b9e4e11bc896962bc1", "excerpt_id": "42e42212bb275b8220fae74e70d3abaf7a1923b6be1be5276345066a5f63df5f", "quote": "Kimi Slides handles the entire slide-building process", "source_revision": "cb616c7202f96475660046416314aaaca45ecd39a8f47f79d8da4decad98fe52", "video_id": "2084245813782585345"}, {"card_hash": "be1c03f3c0cf2576cc9f28d1fb4aa19bb094e6105745695ad3646018b5a1d291", "excerpt_id": "fd64fd773fe9c5a2edb84bcd98c07f446f4d323e57cb4cb512454b0db1b675e6", "quote": "It can order food, book flights, shop, deeply research, you name it", "source_revision": "5feae371722596ed4d9af2bc2322bb462f6cd7014ce8264f2ab91eb06aa21ae1", "video_id": "2085010685562626048"}, {"card_hash": "271242eaf23e9144ad8192dadf8cabfb929ccf4981559637d7b7da67011b15d8", "excerpt_id": "ecb436555dee9c7ca27b4fcbe61455f9730e9f33c7c5aca661e22d2167ff5d71", "quote": "Today it read 184 of our Meta ads, pulled the 5 patterns that outperform", "source_revision": "a5dc701d7bfdfed2ab6b8e79ea5103ed7a70c4a4041422f5ad2d3473ae75adad", "video_id": "2085046911103270913"}, {"card_hash": "ea33881541f7580c80996dec01cc556a440905fe3c2b271e35ff68e87ae70eb6", "excerpt_id": "87395098d4cbe31201516e2a3f5b8b034b4539ee19971f2de2a11c714428762e", "quote": "Built for complex real-world driving, this open reasoning model adds 360° awareness", "source_revision": "f2c124b81751a266b886d726151907e80c29379079ff4a8f907a3b1a37b31757", "video_id": "2084663739400249344"}, {"card_hash": "c6fde7a0b2e16d4088a8e7deea183c74393c2b158f976730cd381f826c39c904", "excerpt_id": "2b45625e40e17517834ff1632b7545c50b27baf32eef3ddcfd94b6b63e7d28ef", "quote": "the models have become capable enough to do most of their work on your computers", "source_revision": "619c41967e677357229be0e6d1fc3d72e21abded584958b0571b04b76fbd148b", "video_id": "2085414600552628224"}]}, {"definition": "Commentary on AI company competition, executive rivalries, infrastructure investment, and market or reputational positioning that is not focused on a spec